nt": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Bill and I are in agreement about this.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le08ob08aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "paragraph ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a group of sentences with one idea ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The first paragraph is about my opinion.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le08ob08aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": " to offer ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to present something to someone ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: <span class=\"strong\">Joe</span>: Can I offer you a drink? <br /> <span class =\"strong\">Nancy</span>: Sure!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn2le08ob08aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn2le08ob08re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Present Simple Tense", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Use the Present Simple to talk about facts and usual actions.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "To form the negative, use do/does not  before the verb. </br>Do not add s to the verb when used with he, she, it.</br> Pay attention to the short form <span class=\"italic\">don't</span>. It's used in talking.</br></br>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "To form a yes/no question, use do/does and change the word order like this:         \tDo/Does + subject + verb </br>Do not add s to the verb with he, she, it.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Evening work is difficult.", "type": "example"}, {"content": " I don't know if the company can afford it.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Do the employees work a lot of overtime?", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Write an e-mail to your boss. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use the Present Continuous tense.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Disagree politely about something.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Use expressions to give your opinion.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Salutation:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sentence 1:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sentence 2:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sentence 3:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sign off:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Name:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write complete statements in an e-mail.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use expressions to give my opinion.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I disagree politely.", "type": "text"}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn2le08ob08re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn2le08ob08re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "", "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn2le08ob08re2img01.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Bill</span>: Thank you everyone. The last issue I want to bring up is the night shift.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Paula</span>: Oh, is there a problem, Bill?<br/>", "time": "10"}, {"image": "engenn2le08ob08re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Bill</span>: Well, evening work is difficult. Our employees want to spend time with their families.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Paula</span>: What are you suggesting?<br/><span class=\"strong\">Bill</span>: I'm suggesting that our employees should finish work at 5 p.m. I believe our company employees don't need to work the night shift. Paula, what do you think?<br/>", "time": "7000"}, {"image": "engenn2le08ob08re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Paula</span>: I have to look at the numbers. <br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Bill</span>: I think it is important. Get back to me ASAP.<br />\n<span class=\"strong\">Paula</span>: I don't know if the company can afford it.", "time": "26500"}], "coverimg": "engenn2le08ob08re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}, {"id": 2, "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "", "id": 0, "text": "", "time": "0"}, {"image": "", "id": 1, "text": "<span class = \"bullet\">Formal e-mail</span>", "time": "5000"}, {"image": "", "id": 2, "text": "<span class = \"bullet\">E-mail structure</span>", "time": "22500"}], "video_src": "engenn2le08ob08re3vid01"}, "type": "video"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "video", "title": ""}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [0], "img_path": "", "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "I can write a short, formal e-mail.  ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can politely disagree with colleagues. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can politely give my opinion.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "What are some polite ways to disagree with someone? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "Can you use these phrases at work? Why or why not?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome"